---
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/common/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'February 2025';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read the Free Accurate Calculator Privacy Policy. Learn about our commitment to user privacy, client-side calculation processing, cookies, and Google AdSense compliance."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />

    <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
      <span class="mono-eyebrow text-link">Legal Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="heading-lg text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-mute font-mono">Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-sm dark:prose-invert space-y-6 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
      <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">1. Overview and Core Privacy Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>Free Accurate Calculator</strong> (accessible at <code>freeaccuratecalculator.com</code>), we believe calculation tools should respect your privacy. All financial numbers, health statistics, and numerical inputs entered into our calculator fields are processed <strong>entirely client-side in your web browser</strong>. We do not transmit, record, or store your calculation entries on our servers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">2. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not require you to create an account, log in, or provide personal identification details (such as your name, physical address, Social Security number, or phone number) to use any calculator on this website. Any calculation history is stored exclusively in your browser's <code>localStorage</code> and remains solely on your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">3. Cookies and Google AdSense Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We partner with third-party advertising networks, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, to display advertisements when you visit our website. Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites on the Internet:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-body">
          <li>
            <strong>DoubleClick Cookie:</strong> Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Opting Out of Personalized Advertising:</strong> You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link underline">Google Ads Settings</a> or by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link underline">www.aboutads.info</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Non-Personalized Ads:</strong> For users in regions requiring explicit consent who decline non-essential cookies, ads served will be non-personalized contextual ads.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">4. European Economic Area (EEA) and UK Consent (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the UK Data Protection Act:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-body">
          <li>Visitors from the EEA and the United Kingdom are presented with a consent banner prior to any non-essential cookie or advertising tracking being activated.</li>
          <li>You may update or revoke your cookie preferences at any time by clearing your browser cookies or clicking the cookie settings link in our site footer.</li>
          <li>Our lawful basis for serving personalized advertising is your explicit affirmative consent. For essential functions (such as saving your preferred dark/light theme or currency selection in local storage), our basis is legitimate interest in operating our web service.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">5. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA / CPRA)</h2>
        <p>
          If you are a California resident, you have the right to request disclosure regarding categories of personal information collected or shared. Free Accurate Calculator does not sell personal information. Third-party advertising partners may use device identifiers for ad personalization as described in Section 3.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">6. Log Files and Edge Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          Like most web platforms, our hosting infrastructure on Cloudflare automatically receives standard HTTP request telemetry, including IP addresses, browser user agent strings, and request timestamps. This information is utilized strictly for DDoS mitigation, edge routing, and aggregate performance metrics.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">7. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to inquire about our data practices, please contact our privacy compliance team at:
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-ink bg-canvas p-2.5 rounded-[6px] border border-hairline">
          privacy@freeaccuratecalculator.com
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
